{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_012_01_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:40a84e02825d034610deb52c0330a1cd67b00ec0f2a1829b2c7f2f6e15372c32",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4af415bfd673ad5c1723df326fb8fd1ffb1b2f38c4b8b5e1e4468906fa2c4b5",
      "text": "……所以接下来，你是打算和类一起\n去当偶像的意思吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:933342ab72034bfb7f2c5c12492cb0007f8a1cb02b08414d3177bae4d8d0a7f1",
      "text": "That's right！\n听起来很有意思吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e474b323d1396131a9da12b8d294cfa4c42aaf8907e5df09b1ca92019335acd4",
      "text": "不，嘛……\n我虽然理解了硲先生的热情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a66ed4b67266ac2e4f720f147f1996dfcca617dc84fc37df127f955badd90cfe",
      "text": "现实问题是，实际情况如何呢？\n真的有能当上偶像的指望吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c6fbcd6481387a5e7f88324497c0ef826fbadf79b1d93705598ae202ff24171",
      "text": "我打算首先和舞田君一起，\n去四处参加试镜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03968d409ed2fa2f5c68bcf9d2726f87bcf4fd02897d092038251ff0abb94f21",
      "text": "两个人脚踏实地地干啊。\n看起来挺辛苦的呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d63bd12c33f0fa10079844e35e805b1b764e41b47a9cb461d33a4c93ce05e6ba",
      "text": "关于这件事，山下君，其实我也想\n邀请你一起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d459263f5c27e1ea2157b40532f188debf2d061dc8ce48ce0765bb372d5cd710",
      "text": "诶？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e8a9080cd9d645e7b79e2469dd87470e84c72fa966259cdc37346168369502e",
      "text": "来我们文化祭的Jupiter，\n是三人组合吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d2a4c46c1a338a460b2deef8afac2299baa21aeba5f007e13d5b2f76118e258",
      "text": "……我不仅希望舞田君，\n也希望你能来帮我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_h:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d09e78c437ab8524d5e9a95ed955c79f23581ee1efd990d760da9b8cba732dce",
      "text": "山下君，要不要和我们一起以偶像为目标？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
